caption: Every Jutsu Tradition defines
engine-rule: every-jutsu-tradition-defines

Its Potence-governing trait and advancement.

At least one Mastery-eligible initial tree, its institutional-instance fields, and the rules by which legal later authorship extends that same tree.

Every Jutsu advantage, prerequisite, parameter value, and point cost.

The energy source, recovery, activation conventions, and action economy.

The rule applying the two-times-Potence cap separately to every parameter.

Teaching, recording, inheritance, awakening, or other transmission procedures.

Any uninstructed-access exception.

Mastery requirements and benefits.

Its associated Jutsu Author continuation, if any.
